    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This creative thesis though the Stanford FGSS department is my way of presenting my findings on trauma in the psyche of black-gay males in contemporary America. The novel is a dark-comedy that follows the life of a black-gay teenager during his senior year of high school. The companion essay shows how I imbued my research into the novel.",
